<title>NEW ZEALAND: Schedule for this week's NZ coalition talks.</title>
<headline>Schedule for this week's NZ coalition talks.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Zealand First party on Monday announced the following schedule for formal coalition negotiations with the caretaker National government and main opposition Labour party.</p>
<p>Tue, Nov 5:  2 p.m.  National</p>
<p>		     5 p.m.  Labour</p>
<p>Wed, Nov 6:  10 a.m. National</p>
<p>			2 p.m. Labour</p>
<p>Thu, Nov 7:  10 a.m. National</p>
<p>			2 p.m. Labour</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
</text>
